<h3><u>Ye kaun gira</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Kaaba hai siyahposh falak mehwe buka hai<br>Ye gumbade aflaak se kyu shor utha hai<br>Kohram baqaiyya ki fizao me bapa hai - 2</p><p>Ye kaun gira - 2</p><p>Ye kaun gira reti per - 2</p><p>1. Tha waqte asr arshe moalla pe shor tha - 2<br>Wa hasrata ke zeen se zameen per koi gira<br>Kaapi zameen chashme malaaek ko yu laga<br>Quran rehle zeen se sare farsh gir pada - 2<br>Deeware kaaba bayth gayi arsh gir pada</p><p class="""">2. Girte hi iske kaabe ki deewar gir gayi<br>Sar aasman ka jhuk gaya dastaar gir gayi<br>Insaniyat ki dehr me sarkaar gir gayi<br>Zakhmo se chur chur hai jhuk kar kamaan hai - 2<br>Hairaan hai maut khauf nahi itmenaan hai</p><p>3. Ye hogaya maalum ye khaasaane khuda hai<br>Ye aisa bashar hai jo zamane se juda hai<br>Qaunain me kyu iske liye hashr bapa hai<br>Kyu iske liye arshe moalla pe hai matam - 2<br>Rote hai nabi saare siyah posh hai adam</p><p>4. Ye marde khuda shahe arab aala nasab hai<br>Alhamd se wan naas talak iska hi sab hai<br>Baba ka nasab maa ka hasab iska hasab hai<br>Teero ke musalle pe jo sajde me gira hai - 2<br>Islam isi sar se madad maang raha hai</p><p>5. Aye shahe mashraqain hamara salam le<br>Haider ke zebo zayn hamara salam le<br>Zehra ke dil ka chayn hamara salam le<br>Insaniyat ke deen ka imaan ka salam - 2<br>Karle qubool sarwaro rehan ka salam</p></p>
